alive:
And simultaneous shiver of moiré silk;
While all the aisles, alive and black with heads,
Crawled slowly toward the altar from the street,

alice:
Nature kind hath fashioned you
Like the soul of Alice;
It of purest white is wrought,

alight:
This Phoebe join'd.--They wing their instant flight;
Thebes trembled as th' immortal pow'rs alight.
With clouds incompass'd glorious Phoebus stands;

alibi:
'T is vegetation's juggler,
The germ of alibi;
Doth like a bubble antedate,
